==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{inherited|tr|trk-oat|şu}}, from {{m|trk-oat|şol}} (by analogy of {{m|tr|bu||this}}), from earlier {{m|trk-oat|uş ol}}, equivalent to {{m|tr|uş||lo!}} + {{m|tr|o||she, he, it, that}}. Compare {{m|tr|şimdi||now}}, {{m|tr|işte||lo!}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃu/|lang=tr}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|tr|pronoun}}

# [[that]] (that over there)
#: {{ux|tr|'''şu''' kedi diğerlerinden daha zayıf|'''that''' cat is thinner than the others}}
#: {{ux|tr|'''şuna''' bak!|look '''at that'''!}}
#: {{ux|tr|'''şunlar''' senin arkadaşların değil mi?|aren't '''those''' your friends?}}

